        "original_id": "a6e40d0a-4830-5df5-96a9-94ff4e41a267",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Erik Watts, Bill Watts, Scott Anton, Glacier, Jorge Estrada\n- Organizations: WWE, TCW\n- Products: TCW Tag Team Championship, TCW Heavyweight Championship\n- Places: Dothan, Alabama\n\nFacts:\n- Bill Watts was born on May 5, 1939.\n- Bill Watts is an American former professional wrestler, promoter, and WWE Hall of Fame inductee from 2009.\n- Erik Watts is the son of Bill Watts.\n- On March 3, 2001, Scott Anton and Erik Watts originally won the TCW Tag Team Championship.\n- Scott Anton and Erik Watts won the TCW Tag Team Championship by defeating Glacier and Jorge Estrada in Dothan, Alabama.\n- Glacier and Jorge Estrada were also the opponents for the TCW Heavyweight Championship in that match context.",
